  <name>ControlRemainingCCDNumbersWhileImportingGoodsUsingGoodsInTransitScheme</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Control remaining CCD numbers while importing goods using the &quot;goods in transit&quot; scheme </value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>کنترل شماره‌های CCD باقی‌مانده هنگام واردات کالا با طرح &quot;کالاهای در راه&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Controllare i saldi dei numeri della polizza di carico doganale all'importazione dal fornitore secondo lo schema&quot;merci in corso&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Kontroluj pozostałości numerów TDC przy imporcie według schematu &quot;wiersze pozycji w drodze&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Контролировать остатки номеров ГТД при импорте по схеме &quot;товары в пути&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>&quot;Transit mallar&quot; şemasına göre ithalat sırasında GKB numaralarının bakiyelerini kontrol et</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Kiểm soát số dư của số TKHQ khi nhập khẩu theo sơ đồ &quot;hàng đi đường&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <location>Constant.ControlRemainingCCDNumbersWhileImportingGoodsUsingGoodsInTransitScheme</location>
  <privilegedGetMode>true</privilegedGetMode>
